Black's bishop on f8 could use one more friend — its defense is a little thin. Only Black's king on e8 and the rook on h8 keep it defended.

White's minor pieces have found real work; their counterparts are still waiting for a career. Black's f8-bishop is biting on granite — its own pawns on c5 and d6 block every road it wants to travel. Meanwhile, White is slightly ahead on material. White is a pawn up.
